00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:35.283
<v Host>It means to carry or transport.

00:04:35.884 --> 00:04:43.995
<v Slow>そして、会社の努力だけでは、もう難しいと話しています。

00:04:44.795 --> 00:04:48.588
<v Host>It also says its own efforts alone are no longer enough.

00:04:49.187 --> 00:04:51.420
<v Vocab>努力

00:04:51.819 --> 00:04:53.692
<v Host>It means effort.

00:04:54.291 --> 00:05:07.444
<v Slow>「キッコーマン食品」も、「デルモンテ」のケチャップなど58の商品の値段を、来年3月1日から上げます。

00:05:08.244 --> 00:05:15.732
<v Host>Kikkoman Foods will also raise prices on fifty-eight products, including Del Monte ketchup, from March first.

